  "notes": "- The default root is bifrost-uploads/. fileName must be a file name without folders; use path or folderPath for directories.\n- `storageCode` is optional. A session without it can only end in Storage.Upload.CommitToRecord or Storage.Upload.CommitToDataExchange; Storage.Upload.Commit refuses it with PreconditionFailed.\n- With a `storageCode` the destination is `path`, else `folderPath` and `fileName`, else the folder `bifrost-uploads` and `fileName`. It is fixed when the session begins and returned as `path`; without a `storageCode`, `path` is empty.\n- `fileName` is a name only: a folder or relative segment is refused with InvalidParameter.\n- When `declaredSize` is above 0, a commit is refused unless the received size equals it.\n- A session belongs to the user who began it; any other user gets RecordNotFound for its `uploadId`."
